Brand data in data/canadian-brands.js is compiled from the r/BuyCanadian
community wiki (https://www.reddit.com/r/BuyCanadian/wiki/) and remains the work
of that community, used here with attribution. Factual brand listings are not
themselves copyrightable; the compilation is provided as-is with no warranty of
accuracy or completeness.

This project is an independent clean-room work. It was inspired by the Knockoff
extension's approach but contains none of its code or data.
